0Z","text":"Due to popular demand, CNN will re-broadcast the Larry King Live show I hosted in June, in which I interview Larry. Monday July 5, 9 pm CNN","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/17580961111","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:17572473837","platform":"x","post_id":"17572473837","published_at":"2010-07-02T13:41:07.000Z","text":"Wishing everyone a wonderful Independence Day weekend. We have a lot to be thankful for.","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/17572473837","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"},{"id":"x:17494917112","platform":"x","post_id":"17494917112","published_at":"2010-07-01T14:11:25.000Z","text":"Work is expected to begin today on my golf course in Scotland. It will be spectacular! http://bit.ly/blp1Tq","kind":"original","source_ids":["3dl-kaggle-v1"],"original_url":"https://x.com/realdonaldtrump/status/17494917112","source_deleted_flag":false,"media_count":0,"text_source":"3dl-kaggle-v1","content_status":"text"}]